# abssctl

- Package lives under `src/abssctl/`. Version is `__version__` in `src/abssctl/__init__.py`.
- Living TODO: `docs/PATH_FORWARD.md`. Cursor workflow: `docs/CURSOR_WORKFLOW.md`.
- Cite `docs/requirements/abssctl-app-specs.txt` and ADRs. Do not paste them into chat.
- One chat per PATH_FORWARD step. Hand off with the template in `docs/CURSOR_WORKFLOW.md`.
- Acceptance gate is `make quick-tests`. Docs changes also run `make docs`.
- Actual 25.11+ requires Node >= 22 via `abssctl node ensure`. The CLI installs `@actual-app/sync-server`, not `@actual-app/cli`.
- Commit only when asked. `ops/session-log.txt` and `ops/ai-directives.txt` are archived.
- Ignore `mutants/` (local mutmut output).
